  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "生活中的工程與科技",
    "sub_ename": "THE ENGINEERING AND TECHNOLOGY OF SCIENCE IN DAILY LIFE",
    "describe_ch": "人們在生活中享受各種工程與科技的成果(如建築、道路、下水道、橋樑、捷運、高鐵、網路、GPS、電機、資訊、通訊、材料、化工等)而不自知，亦常聽聞甚至經歷各式天然及工程的災害(如地震、土石流、崩塌等)，透過本課程深入淺出的介紹，讓學生認識生活週遭工程和科技的發展進程，並瞭解天然及工程災害的型態和成因，藉以建立心存感念及人與環境和諧共存之基本認知。",
    "describe_eh": "People enjoy the conveniences brought by the accomplishments of engineering and technology of science (buildings, roads, sewer system, bridges, MRT, HSR，internets， and GPS etc. ) without knowing how they come. And heard or even experienced all kinds of natural and engineering disasters occasionally occurred on earth (earthquake, debris flow, and landslide etc.). Through the simple introduction of the lesson, students can realize the developing process of various engineering and technology of science, and understand how the different types of natural and engineering disasters happen. Therefore they can learn the basic knowledge of how to live harmonically with the surrounding environments。",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 2.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "使學生了解生活週遭工程和科技的發展進程，進而培養不同領域的學習興趣。",
      "describe_en": "Help the students to realize the developing process of various engineering and technology of science which are surrounding us, and to foster further learning interests in other different fields。"
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "讓學生了解天然及工程災害的型態有哪些，以學習建立人與環境和諧共存之基本認知。",
      "describe_en": "Help the students to know the different types of natural and engineering disasters, and to learn the basic knowledge of how they can live harmonically with the surrounding environments."
    }
  ],
